{"ref":"BDB, שְׂמָאלִי","hw":"שְׂמָאלִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמָאלִי</span></big>  <strong>adj. left, on the left</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.21\">1 K 7:21</a> +; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמָאלִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.15\">Lv 14:15</a> +;—<em>left</em> (usually opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְמָנִי</span>), pillar <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.21\">1 K 7:21</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.17\">2 Ch 3:17</a>, side of temple <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.11\">2 K 11:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.10\">2 Ch 23:10</a>, side of body <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.4\">Ez 4:4</a>, palm <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.15\">Lv 14:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.27\">27</a> (P).","next":"BDB, שָׂמַח","prev":"BDB, שִׂמְאֵל"}